<title>DUBAI: Iran's NIOC increases bunker fuel prices.</title>
<headline>Iran's NIOC increases bunker fuel prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Iranian Oil Company (NIOC) has raised its 280-cst bunker prices from Kharg Island to $103.50 a tonne from $101 with effect August 7, the company said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Bunkers from Bandar Mahshahr are raised $4 a tonne to $100.</p>
</text>
